Supra BLS algorithm attribution

The FT mapping, SHA-256 expansion, domain and BN254 constants in src/crypto.rs
and tools/crypto.ts are adapted from the publicly verified Supra BLS.sol algorithm.
The checked-arithmetic-witness optimization and compact codec are original to
the original experiment. This is not an official Supra integration or an endorsement.

